      ***Javelin.*** *Melee or Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Javelin]), reach 5 ft. or range 30/120 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Javelin]) Piercing damage.

